<title>SRI LANKA: Hatton National 9-mth profit shade up.</title>
<headline>Hatton National 9-mth profit shade up.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Unaudited results of Hatton National Bank Ltd for the nine months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>		(in millions of rupees unless stated):</p>
<p>		     9 months 1996	 9 months 1995</p>
<p>    Turnover	  3,461.50    vs	2,480.83</p>
<p>    Net profit	  344.51    vs	  342.07</p>
<p>    Tax provision	80.00    vs	   68.84</p>
<p>NOTE - Hatton National Bank is one of four private banks listed in Colombo.</p>
<p>--Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
